fsYmBYmKbeyvxtEl_5dA89PbtPIsHSvcW-PNkHAJg1dwA&oe=699ADEE1"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1061517104420269", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036641_1061517107753602_1383467785716530594_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GaugiAIcmysQ7kNvwGIX4u7&_nc_oc=Admw_bxiOgv0fOJ7zQ6b9U4QvkpJcRYUCzMWOtBsDozpvxdN1HZf-DydvVG2Tz0A_H8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft7fjTYijUk-o9WeP_P7zv1A5JxgHhcZgIcnUxqJ0CfTA&oe=699AEE75"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Screenshot 2022-07-03 20ffff1916.png", "id": "3478847289006005", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974897_3478847295672671_208656237028816676_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=btVn-LWcy6cQ7kNvwHvBChx&_nc_oc=AdnPP-wTIrRxo6DB7IMPb1q3-dX-aboNvSf5e37Ad7UIb4AIxBP93oKpWSL8BtaLuOo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftRay-veKzSlkhiiozUCcE2-9S8gjdxgw2ZUCDbNvuOZw&oe=699AFAE0"}, "display_name": "Blockies VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Blockies VR is a single player action-puzzle game where you knock down block buildings and protect friendly Blockies against the forces of evil. Launch a wide range of objects at enemies in this low-poly physics world. Travel to the Kingdom\u2019s shop to expand your weapon arsenal to take on the most difficult puzzles in all the land.\n\nFeatures\n-A dozen types of blocks that interact uniquely with the world\n-A dozen AI enemy types each with their own abilities\n-Levels where you must defend the Blockies from monster attacks\n-Levels with intricate block puzzles to solve\n-The Kingdom where cool new projectiles can be purchased\n-Beautifully designed low poly environments\n-At least 50 levels by full release (Currently 16)\n-With enough support: Level Editor to create and share new levels\n-With enough support: Co-op and Multiplayer Functionality\n\nJoin the Discord to learn more about future updates, and provide your own feedback of what 